   "text": "$10 Billion Valuation? DensityAI's Bold Move in AI Chips \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udcb0\n\ud83d\udea8 News Alert: AI chip startup DensityAI, made up of core members from Tesla's Dojo team, is reportedly in late-stage talks to raise hundreds of millions of dollars at a staggering $10 billion valuation. Venture capital giant Andreessen Horowitz (a16z) is leading the negotiations. \ud83d\udca1\nFor context, this valuation eclipses key competitors like Groq ($2.8B) and Etched ($2.1B). So, what's the big deal here?\nDensityAI is more than just another AI #chip venture. It's a full-stack powerhouse founded by former Tesla Dojo engineering leaders:\nGanesh Venkataramanan (ex-lead of Tesla Dojo project),\nBill Chang (CTO, ex-Tesla Dojo Chief Architect),",
